Z||000004||Boomtastic||12-04-2001||04:48 AM||||   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B>Hmmm I just re-read that. What I was on? Well the chair in my study of course     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> I figured you'd get a kick out of that.<P>I also forgot to mention that the top piece (the one directly behind the speaker) has the vinyl sewn around the speaker opening. The bottom piece is held down by door panel retainers (the white "Christmas Tree" type) so that it could be removed if necessary. <P>I know Chester will post some pictures when he gets his back, as he went "ga-ga" when I showed him my speaker box this past weekend.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Boomtastic (edited 12-04-2001).]||||reg||1
